{"title":"2022 AMC 8 Problems/Problem 3","text":"<div class=\"mw-content-ltr mw-parser-output\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><div id=\"toc\" class=\"toc\" role=\"navigation\" aria-labelledby=\"mw-toc-heading\"><input type=\"checkbox\" role=\"button\" id=\"toctogglecheckbox\" class=\"toctogglecheckbox\" style=\"display:none\" /><div class=\"toctitle\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><h2 id=\"mw-toc-heading\">Contents</h2><span class=\"toctogglespan\"><label class=\"toctogglelabel\" for=\"toctogglecheckbox\"></label></span></div>\n<ul>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-1\"><a href=\"#Problem\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">1</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Problem</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-2\"><a href=\"#Solution_1\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">2</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Solution 1</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-3\"><a href=\"#Solution_2\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">3</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Solution 2</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-4\"><a href=\"#Video_Solution_(A_Creative_Way_To_Think)\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">4</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Video Solution (A Creative Way To Think)</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-5\"><a href=\"#Video_Solution_1_by_Math-X_(First_understand_the_problem!!!)\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">5</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Video Solution 1 by Math-X (First understand the problem!!!)</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-6\"><a href=\"#Video_Solution_2_(CREATIVE_THINKING!!!)\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">6</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Video Solution 2 (CREATIVE THINKING!!!)</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-7\"><a href=\"#Video_Solution_3\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">7</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Video Solution 3</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-8\"><a href=\"#Video_Solution_4\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">8</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Video Solution 4</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-9\"><a href=\"#Video_Solution_5\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">9</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Video Solution 5</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-10\"><a href=\"#Video_Solution_6\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">10</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Video Solution 6</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-11\"><a href=\"#Video_Solution_7_by_Dr._David\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">11</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Video Solution 7 by Dr. David</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-12\"><a href=\"#Video_Solution_by_SquishBJ_(AIME_Qualifier)\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">12</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Video Solution by SquishBJ (AIME Qualifier)</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-13\"><a href=\"#See_Also\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">13</span> <span class=\"toctext\">See Also</span></a></li>\n</ul>\n</div>\n\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Problem\">Problem</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2022_AMC_8_Problems/Problem_3&amp;action=edit&amp;section=1\" title=\"Edit section: Problem\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>When three positive integers <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/c/7/d/c7d457e388298246adb06c587bccd419ea67f7e8.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$a$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"11\" height=\"10\" />, <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/8/1/3/8136a7ef6a03334a7246df9097e5bcc31ba33fd2.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$b$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"10\" height=\"14\" />, and <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/3/3/7/3372c1cb6d68cf97c2d231acc0b47b95a9ed04cc.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$c$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"10\" height=\"10\" /> are multiplied together, their product is <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/e/5/9/e59e2c6e83eb78cca610a5fd4070ae01c8d4ae60.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$100$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"29\" height=\"14\" />. Suppose <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/7/c/2/7c286a6b2750b9c5c514b55b7f52660b1f66c21f.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$a &lt; b &lt; c$\" style=\"vertical-align: -2px\" width=\"76\" height=\"15\" />. In how many ways can the numbers be chosen?\n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/e/d/2/ed2c77bc9ef456c844333af7896c95b0e116a964.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\textbf{(A) } 0 \\qquad \\textbf{(B) } 1\\qquad\\textbf{(C) } 2\\qquad\\textbf{(D) } 3\\qquad\\textbf{(E) } 4$\" style=\"vertical-align: -5px\" width=\"355\" height=\"18\" />\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Solution_1\">Solution 1</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2022_AMC_8_Problems/Problem_3&amp;action=edit&amp;section=2\" title=\"Edit section: Solution 1\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>The positive divisors of <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/e/5/9/e59e2c6e83eb78cca610a5fd4070ae01c8d4ae60.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$100$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"29\" height=\"14\" /> are <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/6/7/6/67636c51d1647bdace5e2f19abdac78e2706411a.png\" class=\"latexcenter\" alt=\"\\[1,2,4,5,10,20,25,50,100.\\]\" width=\"202\" height=\"16\" />\nIt is clear that <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/9/2/4/924225bae9a4e0337238e7433cc04a678a9c0b15.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$10\\leq c\\leq50,$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"100\" height=\"17\" /> so we apply casework to <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/5/d/8/5d81ffe14dc65d342d075662e3f3bd00898dbd2e.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$c:$\" width=\"16\" height=\"8\" />\n</p>\n<ul><li>If <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/7/0/8/70868a8417fb8ca62de506795e34ae641b02bc73.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$c=10,$\" style=\"vertical-align: -3px\" width=\"54\" height=\"16\" /> then <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/a/7/1/a71533839bb06840a8ede3e361f3bbd90f408698.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$(a,b,c)=(2,5,10).$\" style=\"vertical-align: -5px\" width=\"153\" height=\"20\" /></li></ul>\n<ul><li>If <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/f/8/5/f859307c9d967efa40bd9e64db93402e38a5d25a.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$c=20,$\" style=\"vertical-align: -3px\" width=\"54\" height=\"16\" /> then <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/8/2/f/82f6cbed1ec86164cc1bdc78e737387d605ef31e.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$(a,b,c)=(1,5,20).$\" style=\"vertical-align: -5px\" width=\"153\" height=\"20\" /></li></ul>\n<ul><li>If <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/7/3/e/73e84094e0b095a21aa7ecc0fd3eb92f2e5938d4.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$c=25,$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"57\" height=\"17\" /> then <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/4/5/8/458d7dc2b1275aa94026cb86aee1b257437b625b.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$(a,b,c)=(1,4,25).$\" style=\"vertical-align: -5px\" width=\"153\" height=\"20\" /></li></ul>\n<ul><li>If <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/6/a/d/6adde5234377386d11bd33407d57dc8c488ac61e.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$c=50,$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"57\" height=\"17\" /> then <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/e/4/4/e44e555c9d692eefdea160f6b7375fed8be868d9.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$(a,b,c)=(1,2,50).$\" style=\"vertical-align: -5px\" width=\"153\" height=\"20\" /></li></ul>\n<p>Together, the numbers <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/f/3/b/f3b28547efd22be1c4a05fa193cd7038fc65d71b.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$a,b,$\" style=\"vertical-align: -3px\" width=\"29\" height=\"16\" /> and <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/3/3/7/3372c1cb6d68cf97c2d231acc0b47b95a9ed04cc.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$c$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"10\" height=\"10\" /> can be chosen in <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/c/b/d/cbd606e4d98385629ad40b24dcd123033160ff87.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\boxed{\\textbf{(E) } 4}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -10px\" width=\"54\" height=\"28\" /> ways.\n</p><p>~MRENTHUSIASM\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Solution_2\">Solution 2</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2022_AMC_8_Problems/Problem_3&amp;action=edit&amp;section=3\" title=\"Edit section: Solution 2\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>The positive divisors of <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/e/5/9/e59e2c6e83eb78cca610a5fd4070ae01c8d4ae60.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$100$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"29\" height=\"14\" /> are <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/6/7/6/67636c51d1647bdace5e2f19abdac78e2706411a.png\" class=\"latexcenter\" alt=\"\\[1,2,4,5,10,20,25,50,100.\\]\" width=\"202\" height=\"16\" />\nWe apply casework to <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/c/7/d/c7d457e388298246adb06c587bccd419ea67f7e8.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$a$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"11\" height=\"10\" />:\n</p><p>If <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/5/0/2/502e059d1a020b368aee3a99c5669d88331d321f.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$a=1$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"45\" height=\"14\" />, then there are <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/7/c/d/7cde695f2e4542fd01f860a89189f47a27143b66.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$3$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"11\" height=\"14\" /> cases:\n</p>\n<ul><li><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/1/3/6/13631bf5c0ec34503f6ff4bae301fb6f36d9c8e4.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$b=2,c=50$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"101\" height=\"18\" /></li></ul>\n<ul><li><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/a/d/6/ad67c8a87d86921fc1220783e1647d4f0e7a8515.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$b=4,c=25$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"101\" height=\"18\" /></li></ul>\n<ul><li><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/0/6/6/06666fe8924375b20a070e7789b97660a54575ef.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$b=5,c=20$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"101\" height=\"18\" /></li></ul>\n<p>If <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/5/5/a/55afdab16c8c49089c4d9ceeb8d3c8cf1f088be6.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$a=2$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"45\" height=\"14\" />, then there is only <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/d/c/e/dce34f4dfb2406144304ad0d6106c5382ddd1446.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$1$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"11\" height=\"14\" /> case:\n</p>\n<ul><li><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/4/2/7/42780e37538c3e570ba7297905d3fa2084ccc12c.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$b=5,c=10$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"101\" height=\"18\" /></li></ul>\n<p>In total, there are <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/9/2/5/9258f1a4bb84667f64fffb4631ef56cff8d8f2f2.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$3+1=\\boxed{\\textbf{(E) } 4}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -11px\" width=\"121\" height=\"30\" /> ways to choose distinct positive integer values of <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/a/5/b/a5b29b358e825defa3e11b7d903d43ec31e5909a.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$a,b,c$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"43\" height=\"18\" />.\n</p><p>~MathFun1000\n</p>\n<h2><span id=\"Video_Solution_.28A_Creative_Way_To_Think.29\"></span><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Video_Solution_(A_Creative_Way_To_Think)\">Video Solution (A Creative Way To Think)</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2022_AMC_8_Problems/Problem_3&amp;action=edit&amp;section=4\" title=\"Edit section: Video Solution (A Creative Way To Think)\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p><a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external free\" href=\"https://youtu.be/tYWp6fcUAik?si=V8hv_zOn_zYOi9E5&amp;t=135\">https://youtu.be/tYWp6fcUAik?si=V8hv_zOn_zYOi9E5&amp;t=135</a>\n~hsnacademy\n</p>\n<h2><span id=\"Video_Solution_1_by_Math-X_.28First_understand_the_problem.21.21.21.29\"></span><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Video_Solution_1_by_Math-X_(First_understand_the_problem!!!)\">Video Solution 1 by Math-X (First understand the problem!!!)</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2022_AMC_8_Problems/Problem_3&amp;action=edit&amp;section=5\" title=\"Edit section: Video Solution 1 by Math-X (First understand the problem!!!)\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p><a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external free\" href=\"https://youtu.be/oUEa7AjMF2A?si=tkBYOey2NioTPPPq&amp;t=221\">https://youtu.be/oUEa7AjMF2A?si=tkBYOey2NioTPPPq&amp;t=221</a> \n</p><p>~Math-X\n</p>\n<h2><span id=\"Video_Solution_2_.28CREATIVE_THINKING.21.21.21.29\"></span><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Video_Solution_2_(CREATIVE_THINKING!!!)\">Video Solution 2 (CREATIVE THINKING!!!)</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2022_AMC_8_Problems/Problem_3&amp;action=edit&amp;section=6\" title=\"Edit section: Video Solution 2 (CREATIVE THINKING!!!)\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p><a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external free\" href=\"https://youtu.be/5-6zj2mBBSA\">https://youtu.be/5-6zj2mBBSA</a>\n</p><p>~Education, the Study of Everything\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Video_Solution_3\">Video Solution 3</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2022_AMC_8_Problems/Problem_3&amp;action=edit&amp;section=7\" title=\"Edit section: Video Solution 3\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p><a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external free\" href=\"https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=Ij9pAy6tQSg&amp;t=142\">https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=Ij9pAy6tQSg&amp;t=142</a>\n</p><p>~Interstigation\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Video_Solution_4\">Video Solution 4</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2022_AMC_8_Problems/Problem_3&amp;action=edit&amp;section=8\" title=\"Edit section: Video Solution 4\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p><a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external free\" href=\"https://youtu.be/LHnC_Wz6fOU\">https://youtu.be/LHnC_Wz6fOU</a>\n</p><p>~savannahsolver\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Video_Solution_5\">Video Solution 5</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2022_AMC_8_Problems/Problem_3&amp;action=edit&amp;section=9\" title=\"Edit section: Video Solution 5\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p><a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external free\" href=\"https://youtu.be/Q0R6dnIO95Y?t=98\">https://youtu.be/Q0R6dnIO95Y?t=98</a>\n</p><p>~STEMbreezy\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Video_Solution_6\">Video Solution 6</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2022_AMC_8_Problems/Problem_3&amp;action=edit&amp;section=10\" title=\"Edit section: Video Solution 6\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p><a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external free\" href=\"https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=KkZ95iNlFyc\">https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=KkZ95iNlFyc</a>\n</p><p>~harungurcan\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Video_Solution_7_by_Dr._David\">Video Solution 7 by Dr. David</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2022_AMC_8_Problems/Problem_3&amp;action=edit&amp;section=11\" title=\"Edit section: Video Solution 7 by Dr. David\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p><a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external free\" href=\"https://youtu.be/EbLGPhGVz6E\">https://youtu.be/EbLGPhGVz6E</a>\n</p>\n<h